  "solution": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;-3</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />As&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is not an integer, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8800;0</mo></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;0</mo></math><br /><br />For a root of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> to exist at least one of the roots of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> should be between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>.<br /><br />Roots&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">=</mi><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8723;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />As we observe, one root is surely less than zero,<br /><br />i.e., &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;For a solution to exist,<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo largeop=\"true\">&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
